new-features-windows|Version: 0.1.9 (0.1.10 fix)/nl/Size: 311mb/nl/Features (0.1.10): NEETwork wasn't working on Windows, now it should work/nl/Features (0.1.9):/nl/- 4 new keys to play! (US QWERTY: ;,./) /nl/- New Keyboard mode in editor! (Keys can be auto-positioned depending on its keyboard position in that mode)/nl/- Now you don't get damage from pressing the wrong key, although keys missed can increase the damage, but if you press a key right, that damage is reduced/nl/- Shift + S can also active Slice Mode/nl/- Key mapping is reworked, now it depends on keyboard position, and you can write what key you want to visualize/nl/- Better performance with a chunk system!/nl/- A new effect: Inverted colors/nl/- A lot (really a lot) of bugs fixed!

